<title>
Scan Tool Data Definitions
</title>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007002">
<title>
ECU Power Supply Voltage (Main) (V)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates power supply voltage of blind spot monitor control module (main).
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007003">
<title>
ECU Power Supply Voltage (Sub) (V)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates power supply voltage of blind spot monitor control module (sub).
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007004">
<title>
Internal Temperature (Main) (&#176;C, &#176;F)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates internal temperature of blind spot monitor control module (main).
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007005">
<title>
Internal Temperature (Sub) (&#176;C, &#176;F)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates internal temperature of blind spot monitor control module (sub).
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007006">
<title>
Transmission Type (MT / Other than MT / Undetermined)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates transmission type registered in blind spot monitor control module.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007007">
<title>
Aiming Angle (Main) (&#176;)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates aiming angle of blind spot monitor control module (main) calculated by SUZUKI scan tool. The calculation is made in the scan tool based on dimensions inputted at “Millimeter Wave Radar Aiming Adjustment”.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007008">
<title>
Aiming Angle (Sub) (&#176;)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates aiming angle of blind spot monitor control module (sub) calculated by SUZUKI scan tool. The calculation is made in the scan tool based on dimensions inputted at “Millimeter Wave Radar Aiming Adjustment”.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007009">
<title>
Auto Aiming Angle (Main) (&#176;)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates aiming angle automatically corrected the deviation of millimeter wave radar in blind spot monitor control module (main).
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007010">
<title>
Auto Aiming Angle (Sub) (&#176;)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates aiming angle automatically corrected the deviation of millimeter wave radar in blind spot monitor control module (sub).
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007011">
<title>
Blind Spot Monitor Mode Status (Normal Mode / Rear Cross Traffic Alert OFF Mode / Blind Spot Warning OFF Mode / Unknown)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates operating state of blind spot monitor system.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007012">
<title>
Mirror LED Right / Left (ON / OFF)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates the state of blind spot monitor indicator light.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007013">
<title>
Blind Spot Monitor System Temporary Stop - Yaw Rate Reliability (Not Detected / Detected)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates the state of yaw rate signal received from ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007014">
<title>
Blind Spot Monitor System Temporary Stop - Vehicle Speed Reliability (Not Detected / Detected)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates the state of vehicle speed signal received from ECM.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007015">
<title>
Blind Spot Monitor System Temporary Stop - Steering Angle Sensor Failure Status (Not Detected / Detected)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates the state of steering angle signal received from lighting and turn signal switch.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007016">
<title>
Blind Spot Monitor System Temporary Stop - Steering Angle Sensor Uncalibrated (Not Detected / Detected)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates whether or not the calibration of steering angle sensor is completed.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007017">
<title>
Sensor View Blocked - Left Sensor (Not Detected / Detected)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates whether or not the data processing of millimeter wave radar in blind spot monitor control module (sub) is normal.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA24007018">
<title>
Sensor View Blocked - Right Sensor (Not Detected / Detected)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates whether or not the data processing of millimeter wave radar in blind spot monitor control module (main) is normal.
</ptxt>
</topic>
